translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_3d7e1070:

    # "You have wandered around the forest opening for a while, but there doesn't seem to be anything noticeable in particular, until you wander deeper into the pine forest."
    "你在林间空地附近徘徊了一阵，却似乎没发现什么特别的东西，直到你深入松林。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_fbf1de00:

    # "Suddenly you notice a patch of white in the front, covering most of the trees as the air begins to freeze, slowly the small patch becomes a larger one until everything around you is enveloped in snow."
    "突然，你注意到前方出现了一片白色，覆盖了大半树木。空气开始冻结，那片小小的白色渐渐扩大，直到周围的一切都被白雪笼罩。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_aa4a325f:

    # "You take out your map and mark the spot. This must be the frosted taiga."
    "你取出地图，标记下这个地方。这里一定就是霜冻泰加。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_c90c3bc8:

    # "Around the glade, you wander and pick up a certain plant, it was a chamomile flower."
    "你在林间空地附近徘徊，捡到了一株植物——是一朵洋甘菊花。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_5f9c93bf:

    # "Around the glade, you wander and pick up a certain plant, it was a chamomile flower. You now have [item_number] Chamomile."
    "你在林间空地附近徘徊，捡到了一株植物——是一朵洋甘菊花。你现在有 [item_number] 朵洋甘菊。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_b866f797:

    # "Near the edge of the glade, you find an old satchel tucked beneath a bed of ursinia flowers."
    "在林间空地边缘附近，你发现一个旧挎包，塞在一片乌苏尼亚花下。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_bd0c3fbe:

    # "Inside are neatly folded tailoring notes, written for making warm clothes from lighter cloth."
    "里面整齐地叠着几页裁缝笔记，记载着如何用轻薄布料制作保暖衣物。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_6ab60657:

    # "One page explains how to weave plain linen from softer fibers, so you copy the method into your journal first."
    "其中一页说明了如何用更柔软的纤维织出素色亚麻布，于是你先把方法抄进日志。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_9e8d3ecd:

    # "Another page details a practical pair of linen braies lined for travel in colder weather."
    "另一页详细记载了一条实用的亚麻布裤，内衬适合在更寒冷的天气里赶路。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_56327d3d:

    # msg "You have learnt the recipe for Linen Braies."
    msg "你学会了亚麻布裤的配方。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_65a26318:

    # "You search around the area, there seem to be something ahead of you, but it seems like your level is too low to notice it yet."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，似乎前方有什么东西，但你的等级太低，还无法察觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_ce7fce2b:

    # "You walk around the meadow, and suddenly, you notice a small pamphlet lying between the grass."
    "你在草地间走着，突然注意到一张小传单躺在草丛中。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_694b134f:

    # "It looks to be the same flyer for the travelling carnival, so you quickly put it away."
    "看起来是那场巡回嘉年华的同一张传单，于是你赶紧把它收了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_d1949c0b:

    # "Picking it up, it looks to be a flyer for a travelling carnival, putting it in the back, perhaps you should check it out sometime..."
    "捡起来后，你发现这是巡回嘉年华的传单；你把它收好，也许以后该去看看……"

translate schinese_rewrite ursinia_glade_loop_e91ba75d_1:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_f0bbb654:

    # "You get lost in the snow for a while, but you eventually find a new path leading to a small mountain."
    "你在雪中迷路了一阵，但最终找到一条通往一座小山的新路。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_a2d74c1a:

    # "Though, it looks to be quite dangerous..."
    "不过，看起来相当危险……"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_5d197ea5:

    # "Around the snow forest, you wander and pick up a certain plant, it was a spearmint."
    "你在雪林附近徘徊，捡到了一株植物——是一株留兰香。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_e1db1e3c:

    # "Around the snow forest, you wander and pick up a certain plant, it was a spearmint. You now have [item_number] of them."
    "你在雪林附近徘徊，捡到了一株植物——是一株留兰香。你现在有 [item_number] 株留兰香。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_06881361:

    # "Around the snow forest, you wander and pick up a certain plant, it was a snow berry."
    "你在雪林附近徘徊，捡到了一株植物——是一颗雪莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_2fef919f:

    # "Around the snow forest, you wander and pick up a certain plant, it was a snow berry. You now have [item_number] of them."
    "你在雪林附近徘徊，捡到了一株植物——是一颗雪莓。你现在有 [item_number] 颗雪莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_5810d30d:

    # "With the direction given by the bear guards, you notice the snow-buried path along the taiga forest."
    "在熊族守卫的指引下，你注意到一条沿着泰加林、被积雪掩埋的小路。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_918472eb:

    # "Following the path, it takes a long time until you finally make your way into the snowland."
    "沿着这条路走了很久，你终于来到雪原。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_f36483c2:

    # "The air is freezing cold, and the snow is so deep that you can barely walk through it, but you can see a huge pile of snow in the distance, and the trail leads right to it."
    "空气冷得刺骨，积雪深得你几乎无法前行；但你能看到远处有一大堆积雪，而小径正通向那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_b082fbc6:

    # "As you get closer, you can see the remnants of a collapsed mountain, the snow is piled up in a huge heap, and the air is filled with the scent of crushed pine and cold stone."
    "你走近后，看见一座坍塌山体的残骸。积雪堆成巨大的雪堆，空气中弥漫着被碾碎的松木和寒冷岩石的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite frosted_taiga_loop_e91ba75d_1:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite clawridge_ascent_loop_0add7d50:

    # "Along the ascent, you wander and pick up a certain plant, it was a snow berry."
    "沿着上坡路，你徘徊着捡到一株植物——是一颗雪莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite clawridge_ascent_loop_5f565581:

    # "Along the ascent, you wander and pick up a certain plant, it was a snow berry. You now have [item_number] of them."
    "沿着上坡路，你徘徊着捡到一株植物——是一颗雪莓。你现在有 [item_number] 颗雪莓。"

translate schinese_rewrite clawridge_ascent_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite avalanche_site_loop_ecd7c863:

    # "You follow the trail leading away from the avalanche, the path is barely visible under the snow."
    "你沿着远离雪崩的小径前行，道路在积雪下几乎看不见。"

translate schinese_rewrite avalanche_site_loop_4c45f68f:

    # "As you walk deeper into the mountains, you notice the air getting colder and colder, and the sky gets darker and darker."
    "你越深入群山，越能感觉到空气越来越冷，天空也越来越暗。"

translate schinese_rewrite avalanche_site_loop_a2831157:

    # "Eventually, you find yourself in a mountain pass, the ground is covered with snow and ice, and the wind is howling around you."
    "最终，你来到一处山口，地面覆着冰雪，狂风在四周呼啸。"

translate schinese_rewrite avalanche_site_loop_a00f754b:

    # "In a distant nowhere, you notice a structure over the mountains. It looks like it's been abandoned for a long time, and around the area, a towering figure who is barely visible from where you stand."
    "在遥远的荒僻之处，你注意到山脉上方有一座建筑。它看起来已经废弃很久了，而附近还矗立着一个从你所在位置几乎看不清的高大身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite avalanche_site_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_7cd6badd:

    # "As you explore the pass, the ground trembles beneath your feet suddenly."
    "你探索山口时，脚下的地面突然震颤起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_6ffb5651:

    # "A deep, guttural rumble echoes from above, like ancient stone grinding against itself."
    "一阵低沉而粗重的轰鸣从上方回荡而来，仿佛远古岩石正在彼此摩擦。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_0ab705dc:

    # "In the middle of the pass stands a towering figure. Dark purple skin stretched over powerful muscles, glowing with faint, pulsing blue runes."
    "山口中央站着一个高大的身影。他的深紫色皮肤绷在强健的肌肉上，泛着微弱、脉动的蓝色符文光芒。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_744da3f9:

    # "A massive deer skull mask hides his face, jagged antlers scraping the low-hanging clouds."
    "一副巨大的鹿首面具遮住了他的脸，参差的鹿角擦过低垂的云层。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_e4c5f6fd:

    # "Only a tattered loincloth covers his waist, doing little to hide the immense bulge beneath it."
    "他的腰间只围着一条破烂的缠腰布，几乎遮不住下面巨大的隆起。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_ab7aca3b:

    # "The Jotunn slowly turns his head toward you with curiosity. Icy blue light flares within the empty sockets of the skull."
    "约顿慢慢好奇地朝你转过头来。头骨空洞的眼窝中，冰蓝色的光芒骤然亮起。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_8f1b7fee:

    # "For a moment, the world seems to freeze."
    "有那么一瞬间，世界仿佛冻结了。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_a0a32e11:

    # "You slowly back away into the swirling snow, holding your breath..."
    "你屏住呼吸，慢慢退入翻卷的雪中……"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_0524bfd0:

    # "The giant doesn't seem to notice. You manage to slip away."
    "巨人似乎没有注意到。你设法悄悄离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_0b6f61d3:

    # "Before you can take three steps, the Jotunn slams his massive fist into the ground."
    "你还没走出三步，约顿就用巨大的拳头砸向地面。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_87f80a2e:

    # "A wall of ice erupts in front of you, cutting off any retreat."
    "一堵冰墙在你面前轰然升起，切断了所有退路。"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_8c41db03:

    # e "F-fuck..."
    e "操、操……"

translate schinese_rewrite skullstrewn_pass_loop_e91ba75d:

    # "You search around the area for a while, but there seem to be nothing worth noting nearby."
    "你在附近搜寻了一阵，但周围似乎没有什么值得注意的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_otsovaara_abyss_88d90385:

    # "A building with chimneys that stretches far upwards, it is burning bright red, you can reckon that they are used to keep the tribe warm."
    "一座烟囱高耸的建筑烧得通红，你猜那些炉火是用来为部落取暖的。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_otsovaara_abyss_c5eeea40:

    # "Some coals stored on a few carts near the furnace. They are carefully mined from the cave ahead, and used as fuels for the furnace."
    "熔炉附近几辆推车上存放着一些煤炭。它们是从前方的洞穴中小心开采出来的，用作熔炉的燃料。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_otsovaara_abyss_24419ecd:

    # "You pick up a piece of extra coal from the ground, it might be useful later."
    "你从地上捡起一块多余的煤，也许之后用得上。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_otsovaara_abyss_90be6c5d:

    # "An old traditional totem erects from beneath the ice, there probably aren't a lot of them left in the bear tribe right now."
    "一座古老的传统图腾从冰下竖立而出；如今熊族里大概已经所剩无几了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_b72841d8:

    # "On the wall, a large deer head is mounted, its eyes seem to follow you wherever you go."
    "墙上挂着一只硕大的鹿头标本，它的眼睛似乎无论你走到哪里都在跟着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_865b162c:

    # e "That deer head on the wall, it's a bit creepy, don't you think?"
    e "墙上那只鹿头，感觉有点瘆人，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_cb6287db:

    # m "Ah! Don't you worry your arse off, it's not a real deer. It's just a decoration."
    m "啊！别他妈瞎担心了，那不是真的鹿，只是装饰品。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_42e14d91:

    # e "But why deers? Why not something else?"
    e "可为什么是鹿？为什么不弄点别的？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_60c673d2:

    # m "We just like the look of a deer in the forest, it's a good luck charm. Plus, it's a good conversation starter, don't you think?"
    m "我们只是喜欢鹿在森林里的样子，它是个吉祥物。而且还能拿来当个开启话题的由头，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_910a99c2:

    # e "Well, considering I did ask you about it..."
    e "这个嘛，毕竟确实是我先问的……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_dd86d8b7:

    # "A white mask in frame is hanging on the wall, it is painted with various colors and has a pair of horns on top."
    "墙上挂着一副白色面具，涂着各种颜色，顶端还有一对角。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_631937cd:

    # e "Methis, what's with this mask on the wall?"
    e "Methis，墙上这副面具是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_b2265daf:

    # m "That's, that's not from around here. We found them around the plains and the mountains. I thought you'd know about that?"
    m "那个、那个不是本地的。我们在平原和山里发现了它。我还以为你会知道呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_4e1d3e40:

    # e "I don't, but it looks interesting. What's it for?"
    e "我不知道，但它看起来挺有意思的。这是用来做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_9d5ddbe1:

    # m "Old rituals from the horned fellows, they used to wear these masks to communicate with the spirits of the forest."
    m "这是那些长角家伙的古老仪式。他们过去会戴着这些面具，与森林的灵魂沟通。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_5f2b76e9:

    # m "I am not familiar with the fables and tales of those grass-eaters, but I still find these rituals... interesting."
    m "我对那些食草家伙的传说故事不熟，不过这些仪式……倒是挺有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_267589e4:

    # "A row of ice chunks are placed on the shelves. They are clear and cold, and they seem to be glowing even in the dark."
    "架子上摆着一排冰块。它们晶莹而寒冷，似乎即使在黑暗中也会发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_da7726f3:

    # e "What are these ice chunks for?"
    e "这些冰块是用来做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_3ebf0765:

    # m "Oh, those are just some ice chunks we've collected from the frozen lake. They've been frozen for so long that you can smell the ancestors' scent in there."
    m "哦，那只是我们从冰湖收集来的一些冰块。它们冻了太久，里面都能闻到祖先的气味了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_ee114377:

    # e "Well, for one I might not want to imagine what a thousands years old scent smells like."
    e "呃，先不说别的，我可不想想象几千年前的气味闻起来是什么样。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_11eba957:

    # m "Oh, don't worry, I won't be pressing your little snout against these ice chunks anytime soon."
    m "哦，别担心，我暂时不会把你的小鼻子按到这些冰块上。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_0cf6f430:

    # e "Uh... soon?"
    e "呃……暂时？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_d587b568:

    # m "Just kidding, don't worry about it."
    m "开个玩笑，别在意。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_de50b14f:

    # "You peer at the two mannequins standing in front of the shop, one is wearing an iron armor while the other is barely clothed."
    "你打量着店铺前的两个假人，其中一个穿着铁甲，另一个几乎没穿衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_f5d601b4:

    # e "Methis, what's with these mannequins?"
    e "Methis，这些假人是怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_a65cc66b:

    # m "Did they scare you? They're just here to show off some of the wares we have in the shop."
    m "吓到你了？它们只是用来展示店里的一些货物。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_4edb0d27:

    # e "Uh huh..."
    e "嗯哼……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_4c6ac24f:

    # "Methis stares at you, waiting for you to say something."
    "Methis盯着你，等你说些什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_550a52c5:

    # m "Ah, sometimes they just couldn't stand still, they're a bit... lively, especially Kivy over there."
    m "啊，它们有时就是站不住，多少有点……活泼，尤其是那边的Kivy。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_332753c8:

    # m "Say, I reckon the armors would look good on you, don't you think?"
    m "话说，我觉得那些铠甲穿在你身上会很好看，你不觉得吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_1e70c123:

    # "The shopkeeper grins, but you're not sure if he's joking or not."
    "店主咧嘴一笑，但你不确定他是不是在开玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_246b0251:

    # e "I'm not sure if I want to be wearing heavy armor in the middle of the snow."
    e "我不太想在大雪中间穿着重甲。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_d22e3cc3:

    # m "My assistants wouldn't look half as good in them as you would, heh."
    m "我的助手穿上它们可没你穿着好看，嘿嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_27ff6015:

    # "A purple sculpture lies on the shop's counter, it is of a tall antlered creature with a skull head that kneels on both knees."
    "店铺柜台上摆着一尊紫色雕像，是一个长着鹿角、顶着骷髅头的高大生物，双膝跪地。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_2556e1ae:

    # e "Methis, what's this sculpture you have on your counter?"
    e "Methis，你柜台上的这尊雕像是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_02e71372:

    # m "Oh, that's Jotunn, he's the kind of older than the realm itself."
    m "哦，那是约顿，他的年纪几乎和这个世界一样久。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_c560a666:

    # m "Probably the last living specimen of the old ancestors we have on this realm."
    m "可能是我们这个世界上仅存的远古祖先活体了。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_99f7f2d5:

    # e "Specimen?"
    e "活体样本？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_13bb338e:

    # "Methis nods."
    "Methis点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_64318caf:

    # m "He hides around that tower in the far north, rarely coming down to the tribes."
    m "他藏在遥远北方的那座高塔附近，很少下山来到各个部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_ce53f1d4:

    # m "But don't fret my dear, you can easily spot him, just look for the blue glowstick in the distance..."
    m "不过别担心，亲爱的，你很容易找到他——只要在远处寻找那根蓝色荧光棒……"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_d2b29142:

    # e "A glowstick?"
    e "荧光棒？"

translate schinese_rewrite main_finnkels_gaze_ef92b18b:

    # m "That's what we call that gigantic meaty pole that hangs between his legs, bright like a beacon in the dark."
    m "我们管他两腿之间垂着的那根巨大肉棒叫这个，黑暗中亮得像灯塔一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_80a9198e:

    # "As you wander around the glade, you notice a light brown figure troding through the snow, he's holding a harpoon."
    "你在林间空地附近闲逛时，注意到一个浅棕色身影正踩着雪走来，他手里拿着一支鱼叉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_f9710630:

    # "You recognize him as the bear guard that patrols the area, he sees you as well, but he's not raising any weapons."
    "你认出他就是在这片区域巡逻的熊族守卫。他也看见了你，却没有举起武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_f99d1fe6:

    # bearGuard "Outsider! You're back again, huh?"
    bearGuard "外来者！你又回来了，嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_be174e4b:

    # e "I hope our last encounter didn't leave a bad impression on you. I'm not trying to cause any trouble."
    e "希望我们上次见面没给你留下什么坏印象。我不是来惹麻烦的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_49c6a1ec:

    # bearGuard "You beat us fair and square, but we're not letting you off the hook that easily."
    bearGuard "你光明正大地赢了我们，但我们可不会这么轻易放过你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_96b5c79b:

    # bearGuard "A spar will do, outsider. Let's see if you're still as good as last time." nointeract
    bearGuard "来场切磋吧，外来者。看看你是不是还和上次一样厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_f132ccc5:

    # e "How about a little spar?"
    e "来小小切磋一下怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_d7354b6f:

    # "You raise your weapon, the bear guard quickly catches onto it and raise his harpoon forward."
    "你举起武器，熊族守卫很快会意，也把鱼叉举到身前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_f27f1537:

    # bearGuard "You're not getting away this time, outsider!"
    bearGuard "这次你可跑不掉了，外来者！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_676176e4:

    # "You lower your weapon, the bear guard seems to be more relaxed now."
    "你放下武器，熊族守卫看起来放松了些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_053f95a7:

    # e "See, I'm not here to cause any trouble. I just want to talk."
    e "你看，我不是来惹麻烦的。我只是想聊聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_6ea353ad:

    # bearGuard "Fine, but make it quick, outsider."
    bearGuard "好吧，但快点，外来者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_0403c786:

    # e "So, what's up?"
    e "怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_b9fa7e86:

    # bearGuard "Just patrolling the area, making sure no outsider's causing any trouble around here."
    bearGuard "只是在附近巡逻，确保没有外来者在这里惹麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_0d90c635:

    # bearGuard "You're lucky I didn't catch you last time, outsider."
    bearGuard "上次你走运，没被我抓到，外来者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_ca5298a5:

    # e "Well, the chief didn't seem to mind me being around here."
    e "嗯，首领似乎不介意我在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_3847edd3:

    # bearGuard "It's because you're a courier, but don't think you can just wander around here without any consequences."
    bearGuard "那是因为你是信使，但别以为你可以在这里随便闲逛而不用承担后果。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_a70a3233:

    # e "I thought you were about to attack me like the last few times."
    e "我还以为你会像前几次一样攻击我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_7ea38c8e:

    # bearGuard "Look, you don't seem to be a bad fighter, neither a bad person. We had no wish to shed any blood after the incident with Herd."
    bearGuard "听着，你看起来既不算个差劲的斗士，也不是什么坏人。Herd那次事故之后，我们也不想再流血。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_707cbc53:

    # bearGuard "We weren't trusting you after the stunts you pulled with Herd. But you've proven yourself to be a worthy fighter."
    bearGuard "你和Herd搞出那些事后，我们没法信任你。但你证明了自己是个值得尊敬的战士。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_342cbc70:

    # e "Thanks, I guess."
    e "谢了吧，大概。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_2a66cc73:

    # bearGuard "Patrolling, just like what our commander told us to do."
    bearGuard "巡逻呗，就像我们指挥官吩咐的那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_d645e361:

    # "The bear guard looks around the area, he seems to be on high alert."
    "熊族守卫环顾四周，似乎处于高度警戒状态。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_7be02170:

    # e "Is there something wrong?"
    e "出什么事了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_572e6cf1:

    # bearGuard "Commander Daggi, all due respect, he only got to be the new commander because of his father, not his ability."
    bearGuard "Daggi指挥官，恕我直言，他能当上新指挥官只是因为他父亲，而不是因为他的能力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_297912de:

    # e "H-his father? Who's his father?"
    e "他、他父亲？他父亲是谁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_9c6f98a2:

    # bearGuard "Wait, you don't know? He's the son of chief Kaurhu."
    bearGuard "等等，你不知道？他是Kaurhu首领的儿子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_0507780a:

    # bearGuard "Please tell no one that I told you about this, I don't want to be in trouble with chief."
    bearGuard "请别告诉别人是我说的，我可不想因为这件事和首领过不去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_6da37a70:

    # e "I won't, I promise, but what's the problem with him being the son of the chief?"
    e "我不会的，我保证。但他是首领的儿子，这有什么问题？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_b1ce33cf:

    # bearGuard "He's been trying to prove himself to chief, but we always ended up being the one babysitting the little cub."
    bearGuard "他一直在努力向首领证明自己，但最后总是我们在给这个小崽子当保姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_c82bac4e:

    # bearGuard "He's not a bad leader, but he's not a good one either. He doesn't have the confidence to spearhead the guards. He's just... there."
    bearGuard "他算不上糟糕的领袖，但也谈不上优秀。他没有带头指挥守卫的魄力。他只是……在那里而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_8783b317:

    # e "I see... Were there someone else who could've been a better leader?"
    e "我明白了……还有其他人本来可以当个更好的领袖吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_bf123ac4:

    # bearGuard "Bedwyr, he's the best fighter we have in the tribe. But..."
    bearGuard "Bedwyr，他是部落里最强的战士。但……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_cae5f7d9:

    # bearGuard "I believe I've said enough already."
    bearGuard "我想我已经说得够多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_1ba83304:

    # bearGuard "If you enter our tribe, make sure you follow the rules, outsider."
    bearGuard "如果你进入我们的部落，记得遵守规矩，外来者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_d410d0d9:

    # bearGuard "Once you land in prison, there's no way we're letting you out."
    bearGuard "一旦你进了监狱，我们可不会放你出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_575373f8:

    # e "What's the rules? I thought I was allowed to wander around here."
    e "规矩是什么？我以为我可以在这里随便逛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_3993d73b:

    # "The guard chuckles, before counting on his claws."
    "守卫轻笑一声，然后数了数爪子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_4b46b69a:

    # bearGuard "First rule, be respectful to the tribe and our chief."
    bearGuard "第一条，尊重部落和我们的首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_c432f62c:

    # bearGuard "Second rule, dress appropriately, showing off your cock to anyone will earn you a place in prison. This is an extension to the first rule."
    bearGuard "第二条，穿着得体。向任何人露出你的鸡巴，就会被关进监狱。这也是第一条的延伸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_47774a6e:

    # e "Am I breaking the second rule?"
    e "我违反第二条了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_7948ddeb:

    # bearGuard "As a matter of fact. Yes, and you're gonna pray to Ookko I'm not taking your ass in prison."
    bearGuard "事实上，是的。你最好祈祷Ookko保佑，不然我早把你这屁股抓进监狱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_7a763980:

    # bearGuard "Third rule, no bear puns allowed. This... also an extension to the first rule."
    bearGuard "第三条，不准说熊族的双关笑话。这……也是第一条的延伸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_d1c5e89e:

    # "You can barely hold your desire to defy the rules."
    "你几乎压不住自己想要违抗这些规矩的冲动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_5668425f:

    # bearGuard "Fourth rule, do not venture onto the mountain without a guide, the mountains are dangerously cold, especially for a thin-furred like you."
    bearGuard "第四条，没有向导不许上山。山上冷得要命，尤其是对你这种毛薄的家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_676d98b1:

    # bearGuard "Fifth rule, do not disturb the old familiars. They're the spirits of our ancestors, they're not to be trifled with."
    bearGuard "第五条，不许打扰老灵兽。它们是祖先的灵魂，不是你能随便招惹的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_a22f55ee:

    # bearGuard "Sixth rul... you know what, I think you get the point."
    bearGuard "第六条……算了，我觉得你已经明白重点了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_4f7ff5e6:

    # e "What's the sixth rule?"
    e "第六条是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_40c3775a:

    # bearGuard "N-nothing. Just don't cause any trouble around here, and you'll be fine."
    bearGuard "没、没什么。只要别在这里惹麻烦，你就没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_30d330fe:

    # "The guard nervously shoos you away, before heading a seperate direction."
    "守卫紧张地把你赶走，然后朝另一个方向走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_38f9c07e:

    # bearGuard "Have you seen what that avalanche did to the mountains? It's a miracle that we weren't all buried alive inside that little slit in the ice."
    bearGuard "你看到那场雪崩把山弄成什么样了吗？还好我们没有全都被活埋在冰层那道小裂缝里，真是个奇迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_0ce5a9c3:

    # e "I hadn't... was it the same avalanche Daggi were talking about? Where is it?"
    e "我还没……那是Daggi说的那场雪崩吗？在哪里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_c9ed50a9:

    # bearGuard "It's closed now, we're still trying to recover anything we can find in the mountain, we've cleared the foothill just around this forest, but not anywhere higher."
    bearGuard "现在那里已经封闭了。我们还在设法从山里找回能找到的一切。我们清理了这片森林附近的山麓，但更高的地方还没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_ecf776be:

    # e "Can I take a look there?"
    e "我能去那里看看吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_2f60b320:

    # bearGuard "S-sure? It's close by a short cliff, and it's not like there're anything of value lying around there, just a huge pile of snow."
    bearGuard "当、当然？就在一处不高的悬崖旁边，那里也没什么值钱东西，不就是一大堆雪而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_0f6a8790:

    # bearGuard "The only trail it leads to are the observatory, and don't say we didn't warn you, courier. It's guarded by the Jotunn, a giant monster with his glowstick hanging between his legs."
    bearGuard "那里唯一通往的地方就是天文台。别说我们没警告过你，信使。那里由约顿守卫着——一个把荧光棒挂在两腿间的巨型怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_f7b8bfdc:

    # e "A-alright, I'll just look at the snow..."
    e "好、好吧，我就看看雪……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_542c620d:

    # bearGuard "Whatever, I'm not liable to your safety just to be sure. You'll find a few road signs toward the north from here, following it onward there'll be a trail that extends all the way to the observatory."
    bearGuard "随便，我可不对你的安全负责。你从这里往北会找到几块路标，顺着走就有一条小径，一直通往天文台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_0b74e6d1:

    # "You nod, memorizing the path the guard just described. Perhaps you can discover the site now."
    "你点点头，把守卫刚才描述的路线记在心里。也许现在可以找到那个地点了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_4fd5f167:

    # bearGuard "Protecting the tribe, as always."
    bearGuard "保护部落，一如既往。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_845e5504:

    # bearGuard "But, I've been thinking about getting a new armor from Methis, what do you think, courier?"
    bearGuard "不过，我一直在考虑找Methis弄一套新铠甲，你觉得呢，信使？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_d202f2f8:

    # e "Yours doesn't look that bad, but I think a new armor won't do any harm."
    e "你的这套看起来也不差，不过我觉得换一套新铠甲也没坏处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_51e35880:

    # bearGuard "You're right, courier. But I'm not sure if I want to visit Methis again, he's some odd sorts of rhino in the tribe."
    bearGuard "你说得对，信使。但我不太确定要不要再去找Methis，他可是部落里那个古怪的犀牛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_1a295c6d:

    # e "Odd? How so?"
    e "古怪？怎么说？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_acef927d:

    # bearGuard "Don't you think it's fucking weird to call your mannequins weird names? Not mentioning one of them being that old blacksmith's..."
    bearGuard "你不觉得叫假人一些奇怪的名字很他妈怪吗？更别提其中一个还是那个老铁匠的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_b6a9e487:

    # e "Yeah, I guess so."
    e "嗯，我想也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_d43549bc:

    # bearGuard "Sometimes, when the midnight bell rings, when our shifts end, we hear noises behind the curtains in his shop."
    bearGuard "有时午夜钟声响起、我们换班之后，会听见他店铺帘子后面传来声响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_fa6c57e2:

    # bearGuard "What magical mannequins works by the night... we never dared to ask, but I'm lying if I say we're not curious."
    bearGuard "那些魔法假人竟然在夜里活动……我们从没敢问，但如果说我们不好奇，那就是在撒谎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_815084f0:

    # "The guard looks around the area, as if he's expecting a spirit to pop out of nowhere."
    "守卫环顾四周，仿佛在等某个灵魂凭空冒出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_b9337815:

    # bearGuard "I better get going."
    bearGuard "我最好走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_35263da6:

    # e "I'm just passing by, I'll be on my way."
    e "我只是路过，这就走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_2325223b:

    # bearGuard "Alright, but don't cause any trouble around here..."
    bearGuard "好吧，但别在这里惹麻烦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_4f9c54e4:

    # "You leave the bear guard behind and continue your journey."
    "你把熊族守卫留在身后，继续踏上旅程。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_437288f2:

    # "It's only after a few seconds you can see that he's running towards your direction."
    "过了几秒，你才发现他正朝你的方向跑来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_8ebe2eab:

    # bearGuard "Outsider! Stop right here!"
    bearGuard "外来者！给我站住！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_2382c591:

    # e "Hey, I mean no harm."
    e "嘿，我没有恶意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_1d10a48e:

    # bearGuard "By the name of our chief, I will kick you out of our territory once and for all." nointeract
    bearGuard "以我们首领的名义，我要把你彻底赶出我们的领地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_cef234a5:

    # e "S-shit!"
    e "妈、妈的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_2620f955:

    # "You try to run away from the guard, but you don't seem to have enough {color=#ddd}Agility{/color}. He quickly drags on your leg, pulling you into him."
    "你试图逃离守卫，但你的{color=#ddd}敏捷{/color}似乎不够。他很快一把拖住你的腿，将你拽向自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_baf57d68:

    # bearGuard "Where do you think you're going, now fight me like a real bear."
    bearGuard "你以为自己要去哪儿？现在像真正的熊一样跟我打。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Interaction_cdebdd47:

    # "You run away from the guard, he tries to chase you but you barely manage to lose him in the snow."
    "你逃离了守卫。他试图追赶你，但你总算在雪地里把他甩掉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_e48a86d3:

    # "The bear guard stands rigid in the snow, harpoon resting against his shoulder. His breath fogs the cold air."
    "熊族守卫僵立在雪中，鱼叉靠在肩上。他的呼吸在冷空气中化作白雾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_0ee5da95:

    # "His ears twitch at some distant sound you can't quite make out. For a moment his usual stern expression cracks with unease."
    "他的耳朵因某个你听不太清的远处声音而抽动。片刻间，他平日严厉的表情因不安而出现裂痕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_2b35f89b:

    # bearGuard "...You hear that, outsider?"
    bearGuard "……你听见了吗，外来者？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_104da94a:

    # "He keeps his voice low, almost a growl, eyes flicking toward the thick pines where the wind howls between the trunks."
    "他压低声音，几乎像是在低吼，目光不断瞥向茂密的松林，风正从树干间呼啸而过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_75cbbe42:

    # e "Hear what?"
    e "听见什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_ca3bf61b:

    # bearGuard "Noises. Coming from the old cave up the ridge. Not animal. Not the wind. Something is wrong in there."
    bearGuard "声音。从山脊上那座老洞穴里传来的。不是动物，也不是风。里面不对劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_205f387e:

    # bearGuard "Noises. Coming from the old cave up the ridge. Not animal. Not the wind. Something... or someone is there."
    bearGuard "声音。从山脊上那座老洞穴里传来的。不是动物，也不是风。有什么……或者有人在里面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_827c368b:

    # "His grip tightens on the harpoon shaft, knuckles whitening beneath thick fur."
    "他握紧鱼叉柄，厚厚的皮毛下，指节因用力而泛白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_84b83237:

    # bearGuard "Been hearing it since Herd... since that incident. Like a gust of wind constantly blowing through the cave."
    bearGuard "从Herd那次……从那件事之后就一直听见。像一阵风不停地穿过洞穴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_c17a76c1:

    # "He shifts his weight, boots crunching in the snow."
    "他挪了挪重心，靴子踩在雪上发出咯吱声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_cbee634a:

    # bearGuard "Chief's already dealing with the fallout from what we did to Herd. If I bring this to Commander now, he'll stir up more fear just by showing his face."
    bearGuard "首领已经在处理我们对Herd所作所为的后果了。如果我现在把这件事报告给指挥官，他光是露面就会煽起更多恐慌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_207518b5:

    # bearGuard "We don't need the whole tribe thinking the mountains are cursed on top of everything else."
    bearGuard "除了这些破事，我们不需要整个部落再以为群山受到了诅咒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_c971391b:

    # bearGuard "Been hearing it since Herd got away. Faint. Like someone's trying not to be found."
    bearGuard "从Herd逃走后就一直听见。很轻，像是有人在尽量不让别人找到自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_8ebb9739:

    # "He glances back toward the distant cave mouth, half-hidden by ice and shadow."
    "他回头望向远处的洞口，那里半隐在冰雪和阴影中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_befffd1c:

    # bearGuard "Chief's got enough on his plate hunting for that elk. If I report this, the commander will just make it worse by sending more guards to patrol the area."
    bearGuard "首领为了找那头麋鹿已经够焦头烂额了。如果我报告这件事，指挥官只会派更多守卫来巡逻，让情况更糟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_7eb58e69:

    # "His gaze finally settles on you, heavy and tired."
    "他的目光终于落到你身上，沉重而疲惫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_67a359ac:

    # bearGuard "You wander these woods more than most. If you go poking around that cave... keep your mouth shut about what you find. At least until we know what it is."
    bearGuard "你比大多数人都更常在这片树林里闲逛。如果你要去那座洞穴里探查……就别把发现的东西说出去。至少在我们弄清楚那是什么之前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_c5cbfdae:

    # "He straightens, adjusting his grip on the weapon as if the conversation is already over."
    "他挺直身子，调整着握武器的姿势，仿佛谈话已经结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_d8177b3b:

    # bearGuard "And if you do go... watch your back."
    bearGuard "如果你真的要去……小心背后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_813e41c7:

    # bearGuard "We don't know what's in there, but I don't want the tribe turning it into another story about Herd."
    bearGuard "我们不知道里面有什么，但我不想让部落把它变成又一个关于Herd的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_d24a2b6e:

    # "With that, the bear guard turns and trudges back toward his patrol route, leaving you alone with the distant, uneasy silence of the taiga."
    "说完，熊族守卫转身，艰难地走回巡逻路线，只留下你独自面对泰加林遥远而令人不安的寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_05635432:

    # "The faint noises, if they were ever there, have gone quiet again."
    "那若有若无的声音——如果它们真的存在过——又一次安静下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_d1cd80a7:

    # "You ponder for a moment. After what happened to Herd, going into the cave alone would be foolish. If the noises mean anything, Chief Kaurhu and Daggi need to hear of them."
    "你思索了片刻。Herd出事后，独自进入洞穴实在愚蠢。如果那些声音意味着什么，Kaurhu首领和Daggi需要知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Discovery_1cd33140:

    # "You pause to think it over. You could investigate the cave right now, though that might be dangerous, or report it to the chief and risk bringing trouble down on the bear guard."
    "你停下来仔细考虑。你可以现在就调查洞穴，但那可能很危险；也可以把这件事报告给首领，却有可能给熊族守卫带来麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_fa3ccc17:

    # e "Chief... I need to speak with you. It's about the old cave near the taiga area."
    e "首领……我有件事要和您谈。是关于泰加林附近那座老洞穴的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_febee875:

    # "Kaurhu's ears twitch. He leans forward slightly, the weight of his gaze heavy."
    "Kaurhu的耳朵抽动了一下。他微微前倾，目光沉重得令人喘不过气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_4f47fec8:

    # kh "Speak."
    kh "说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_3943314e:

    # e "I heard there were noises coming from the old cave up the ridge. The bear guard said it was something... or someone. He seemed pretty worried about it."
    e "我听说山脊上那座老洞穴里传来声音。熊族守卫说里面有什么……或者有人。他看起来相当担心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_502dd51b:

    # "Daggi's expression tightens. Kaurhu's eyes narrow, but he doesn't interrupt."
    "Daggi的表情绷紧了。Kaurhu眯起眼睛，却没有打断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_d341798c:

    # kh "And you are the first here instead of the guards."
    kh "而你却比守卫们先到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_118adec5:

    # e "Yes."
    e "是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_56d470c2:

    # "The old bear exhales slowly and closes his eyes for a moment."
    "老熊缓缓呼出一口气，闭上眼睛片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_5922e6f4:

    # kh "Commander."
    kh "指挥官。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_5857e4ce:

    # d "Yes, Chief."
    d "是，首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_a3dbba95:

    # kh "Take two of your most trusted guards and go with [e]. Investigate the cave. Find out what's going on there."
    kh "带上你最信任的两名守卫，和[e]一起去。调查那座洞穴，查清楚里面到底怎么回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_43b9fb13:

    # "Daggi nods once, sharp and professional, though you catch a flicker of unease in his eyes."
    "Daggi利落而专业地点了一下头，但你捕捉到他眼中一闪而过的不安。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_8b4bd694:

    # d "[e], you're with me. Gren and Illoch, you're coming too. We're going to check out that cave."
    d "[e]，你跟我来。Gren、Illoch，你们也来。我们去看看那座洞穴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_4b56e354:

    # kh "And outsider..."
    kh "还有，外来者……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_9eb0f925:

    # "Kaurhu's voice drops, low and warning."
    "Kaurhu的声音压低了，带着警告意味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_35997753:

    # kh "I trust you to keep this quiet. No one else needs to know about this until we figure out what's going on. Do you understand?"
    kh "我相信你会守口如瓶。在弄清楚情况之前，不需要让其他人知道。明白吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_04f0ff4d:

    # e "Understood."
    e "明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_e3793c20:

    # "Daggi gestures for you to follow him out of the hall."
    "Daggi示意你跟着他离开大厅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_eb24fed5:

    # e "I can go, but I need a moment to get myself ready first."
    e "我可以去，但我需要一点时间先准备一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_0c55f6c0:

    # d "Of course, don't take too long."
    d "当然，别耽搁太久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_Continue_2e771d40:

    # e "Chief, I'm ready to set off for the cave."
    e "首领，我已经准备好出发去洞穴了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_Continue_0d9abbe1:

    # kh "Commander, lead our courier out."
    kh "指挥官，带我们的信使出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_Continue_addff6f2:

    # "The old bear doesn't give you another glance."
    "老熊没有再看你一眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_Continue_5857e4ce:

    # d "Yes, Chief."
    d "是，首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Report_To_Chief_Continue_e3793c20:

    # "Daggi gestures for you to follow him out of the hall."
    "Daggi示意你跟着他离开大厅。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_5f598e22:

    # "You follow Commander Daggi and the two guards through the tribe and into the snow-covered forest."
    "你跟着Daggi指挥官和两名守卫穿过部落，进入被白雪覆盖的森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_90c82aac:

    # "Daggi leads the way, his harpoon ready, while the bear guards flank you both, their eyes scanning the surroundings for any signs of danger."
    "Daggi走在前面，鱼叉已经准备好；两名熊族守卫在你们两侧，目光扫视周围，寻找任何危险的迹象。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_f222f0b9:

    # "For a while, only the crunch of snow and the clink of gear break the silence."
    "有一阵子，只有踩雪的咯吱声和装备的碰撞声打破寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_3ffdc653:

    # d "I am glad you came to us first, [e]."
    d "我很高兴你先来找我们，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_d10f0165:

    # d "If there is really someone hiding up there, I'd rather check it properly than leave you to stumble into it alone."
    d "如果真的有人藏在上面，我宁愿好好查清楚，也不想让你一个人莽进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_42b5415f:

    # d "If you've got questions, ask them now. I'll answer what I can."
    d "你有什么问题就现在问吧。我会尽我所能回答。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_eac2bc8e:

    # e "What exactly is up there?"
    e "上面到底有什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_0cb0f584:

    # d "Old ruins. A sealed crypt, if the elders' stories are true."
    d "古老的遗迹。如果长老们的故事是真的，那是一座封闭的墓穴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_4245c645:

    # d "No one is meant to be using it now, but the guards have heard scraping inside, and the cold around it is wrong."
    d "现在没人应该会用它，但守卫听见里面有刮擦声，而且周围的寒气不对劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_fdadc79e:

    # d "After what happened to Herd, I am not dismissing signs like that."
    d "Herd出事之后，这种迹象我不会当作没看见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_fa90db1c:

    # d "With Herd still missing, I cannot ignore the chance he passed through there."
    d "Herd还下落不明，我不能排除他曾经经过那里的可能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_a5ab4614:

    # e "That's not very reassuring."
    e "这可不怎么让人安心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_20d5f1ed:

    # d "No. But I would rather tell you the truth than pretend it is harmless."
    d "不。但我宁愿告诉你真相，也不想假装那里没危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_59209472:

    # e "Do you think this is actually dangerous, or just guards scaring themselves?"
    e "你觉得这真的很危险，还是只是守卫们自己吓自己？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_70e6a8a9:

    # d "Possibly both."
    d "可能两者都是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_81e55a64:

    # d "Old places make people nervous, but nerves do not explain tracks, noises, and missing supplies."
    d "古老的地方会让人紧张，但紧张解释不了踪迹、声音和失踪的补给。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_a5ab4614_1:

    # e "That's not very reassuring."
    e "这可不怎么让人安心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_bbc5edaa:

    # d "I prefer honesty first."
    d "我更愿意先说实话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_30f168c7:

    # d "Still, I'll do my best to get you in and out of this in one piece."
    d "不过，我会尽力让你们进得去，也完整地出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_71a66bd2:

    # e "You're less stern out here than you were in the hall."
    e "你在外面不像在大厅里那么严厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_64a30f66:

    # d "In the hall I have to look like I know what I am doing."
    d "在大厅里，我得装出一副知道自己在做什么的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_15b12bc8:

    # d "Out here I only have to keep a search party in one piece. I'd like to think I can manage that much."
    d "在这里，我只需要让一支搜寻队全员平安。我愿意相信自己至少能做到这一点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_569b5fd9:

    # "You let out a short laugh before you can stop yourself."
    "你没忍住，短促地笑了一声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_bc617389:

    # "The path steepens as you climb higher along the ridge, the pines thinning until little stands between you and the wind."
    "沿着山脊越爬越高，道路变得越来越陡，松林也逐渐稀疏，直到你和狂风之间几乎再无阻隔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_9db6d708:

    # e "So what happens if we do find someone in there?"
    e "那如果我们真的在里面找到人呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_225bd021:

    # d "If it is some lost hunter or frightened fool, we bring them back alive. If it is something worse, we deal with it."
    d "如果是迷路的猎人或受惊的傻瓜，我们就把他活着带回来。如果是更糟的东西，就解决它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_e79d6b19:

    # d "And if this has anything to do with Herd's death, I want to know the truth of it before the mountain buries that too."
    d "如果这和Herd的死有任何关系，我想在山把真相也掩埋之前弄清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_10242023:

    # d "If Herd is somehow tied to this, then I would rather reach him before panic, cold, or the wrong guard does."
    d "如果Herd不知怎么和这件事有关，我宁愿在恐慌、严寒或哪个不对付的守卫找到他之前先找到他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_0ed88c42:

    # d "If I say the complicated version, Gren starts worrying and Illoch gets annoyed at him."
    d "我要是把复杂的版本说出来，Gren就会开始担心，Illoch则会嫌他烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_9459633d:

    # bearGuard "Commander!"
    bearGuard "指挥官！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_f71d1ae2:

    # "Even the guards tense up slightly at the mention of their names."
    "就连两名守卫听到自己的名字，也都稍稍绷紧了身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_3e012e4e:

    # d "Anything else you want to ask before we get there, [e]?" nointeract
    d "在我们到达之前，你还想问什么吗，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_c42e1aa9:

    # e "I won't lie, I'm nervous."
    e "我不骗你，我有点紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_e7334211:

    # d "Good."
    d "很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_a8c75588:

    # d "Nervous people pay attention. Stay with me, follow my lead, and that will do."
    d "紧张的人会引起注意。跟紧我，照我的带领走，就不会有事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_33380855:

    # e "...Alright."
    e "……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_0bf0d97b:

    # e "Whatever's in there, I'm ready for it."
    e "不管里面是什么，我都准备好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_edd35325:

    # d "Good. Keep that spine."
    d "很好。保持这股劲头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_87e0327b:

    # d "Just leave room for caution until we know what we're dealing with."
    d "不过，在知道要面对什么之前，还是留点谨慎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_46986f6f:

    # e "You know, if you want me close, you can just say you enjoy the company."
    e "你知道，如果你想让我待在你身边，直接说你喜欢有人陪着就行了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_a529ea7b:

    # "Gren makes a strangled noise somewhere behind you."
    "Gren在你身后某处发出一声被噎住似的怪声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_61b9285d:

    # d "That is not quite what I said."
    d "我刚才可不是这个意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_e767fb3b:

    # d "But I would rather keep you close than have you wandering off where I cannot help. So stay near me."
    d "但比起让你跑到我帮不上忙的地方，我更愿意让你待在身边。所以别离我太远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_2ccdb91c:

    # "By the time the cave mouth comes into view, the conversation fades on its own."
    "等洞口映入眼帘时，谈话自然而然地淡了下去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_656a4bb4:

    # "A chill runs down your spine. The air feels heavier here, and an eerie silence hangs over the area."
    "一股寒意窜过你的脊背。这里的空气感觉更加沉重，周围笼罩着一片诡异的寂静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_43c0403a:

    # "Daggi stops just outside the cave mouth and looks back at you."
    "Daggi在洞口外停下，回头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_aec491df:

    # d "This is it."
    d "就是这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_32a22036:

    # d "Once we go in, we move carefully. If something startles you, call it out. Do not go out on your own."
    d "进去之后，我们小心行动。有什么东西吓到你就说出来。别擅自离队。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_ba120796:

    # d "I expect an old crypt full of bad air, loose stone, and something that already has half the guards on edge."
    d "我预计里面会是一座充满浊气、松动岩石的老墓穴，还会有某种已经让一半守卫神经紧绷的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_8aed1739:

    # "His grip tightens on the harpoon, then he gives you a brief nod."
    "他握紧鱼叉，随后朝你短促地点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_fc28db5d:

    # d "Stay where I can see you, [e]."
    d "待在我看得见你的地方，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_599c1c30:

    # d "Ready, [e]?"
    d "准备好了吗，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_0dc0ed03:

    # "With that, he steps into the cave, followed by the bear guards."
    "说完，他走进洞穴，熊族守卫紧随其后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Journey_With_Daggi_c533255d:

    # "You take a deep breath and follow them inside, your heart pounding in your chest as you prepare to face whatever lies within."
    "你深吸一口气，跟着他们走进去；胸口心脏砰砰直跳，准备面对里面的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_78f64f1b:

    # d "Well... that's one way to welcome visitors. You alright?"
    d "嗯……这倒是迎接访客的一种方式。你没事吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_5317f5bb:

    # "A heavy click answers him from somewhere inside the wall behind the fallen statues."
    "倒塌雕像后方的墙内某处传来一声沉重的咔哒声，回应了他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_174017e9:

    # "The bronze locking pins buried in the stone begin to withdraw one by one. Then a narrow panel grinds inward, revealing a recess hidden behind the guardians' pedestals."
    "埋在石头里的青铜锁栓一个接一个地缩回。接着，一块狭窄的石板向内轧开，露出守卫雕像基座后隐藏的凹室。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_ff410764:

    # "Inside rests a small stone tablet, no longer than your hand, wrapped in frost and centuries of dust."
    "里面放着一块小石板，不比你的手掌长，表面裹着霜和数百年的尘土。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_8009342a:

    # "Daggi reaches it first, but only to brush the surface clear. Tight rows of hooked symbols run across the tablet's face, old enough that they barely look like writing at all."
    "Daggi第一个碰到它，但只是拂去表面的尘土。石板表面刻着一行行紧密的钩形符号，年代久远得几乎不像文字。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_7a2f30f6:

    # e "Can you read any of that?"
    e "你看得懂那些吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_c80dc78c:

    # d "No."
    d "不。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_dc7c6bc5:

    # d "If it is a bear script, it is older than anything I was taught."
    d "如果那是熊族文字，它比我学过的任何文字都古老。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_d1302e92:

    # "The face of the tablet bears a carved figure beneath the writing: a broad-shouldered warrior with a crown worked into the shape of antlers, one hand on an axe, the other extended over a curling root or vine."
    "石碑的正面刻着文字，下方还有一幅浮雕：一名宽肩的战士，王冠做成鹿角的形状；一只手按着斧头，另一只手伸向盘绕的树根或藤蔓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_b8c54541:

    # d "This must be Stigandr. The conqueror our old stories never shut up about."
    d "这一定是Stigandr。那个我们古老传说里没完没了提起的征服者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_58d66245:

    # e "Or the one they wanted remembered."
    e "或者，只是他们想让人记住的那个人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_182fee1e:

    # "Daggi glances from the tablet to the broken tomb and the ruined guardians."
    "Daggi的目光从石板移到破碎的墓穴和残毁的守卫雕像上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_4b853155:

    # d "A proud warlord, hidden under a mountain with two bronze sentries and a secret sealed behind them."
    d "一个骄傲的军阀，被藏在山下；身旁有两名青铜哨兵，背后还封着一个秘密。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_889ba80e:

    # d "The tribe remembers that he conquered the snow region. It remembers the victory."
    d "部落记得他征服了雪域，也记得那场胜利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_96aea220:

    # d "It does not remember clearly what came after, and I am starting to think that was deliberate."
    d "但没人清楚记得后来发生了什么，我开始觉得那是故意的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_6dbc99dd:

    # "Daggi's eyes drift back toward the offering table and the route you took through the chamber."
    "Daggi的目光又飘向供桌，以及你穿过房间时走过的路线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_55c1888f:

    # d "And Herd was here. The bell, the fresh marks on the table, the astrolabe trapped in the gutter... none of that belongs to grave robbers or wandering hunters."
    d "Herd来过这里。铃铛、供桌上的新鲜痕迹、卡在排水沟里的星盘……这些都不是盗墓者或路过猎人的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_a327c1d1:

    # e "So the guards really were hearing him?"
    e "所以守卫们真的听见他了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_f23e18fa:

    # d "Some of it, maybe. Herd moving through the upper cave. The rest could be this place waking up around him."
    d "也许听见了其中一部分。Herd在上层洞穴里移动的声音。其余的，可能是这个地方随着他醒来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_233bf54c:

    # d "By the time we reached the crypt properly, he was already gone. But at least now I know he came here for something of his own, not just to break our work and disappear."
    d "我们真正找到墓穴时，他已经走了。但至少现在我知道，他来这里是为了自己的某件事，而不只是破坏我们的工作后消失。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_7a2f87e9:

    # "He studies the markings for another breath, then wraps the tablet carefully in a strip of cloth torn from the inside of his bracer."
    "他又看了一会儿那些刻痕，然后小心地用从护腕内侧撕下的一条布把石板包好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_a615f2db:

    # d "We take it to Chief Kaurhu. He should see this before anyone starts inventing stories about it."
    d "我们把它带给Kaurhu首领。他应该在有人开始编故事之前先看看这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_9cc36931:

    # "It takes the better part of an hour for you, Daggi, and the two guards to work your way back toward the blocked cave mouth."
    "你、Daggi和两名守卫花了将近一小时，才设法往堵塞的洞口返回。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_26691551:

    # "At first the entrance is still jammed shut under the earlier collapse, but the constant rumbling from the statues' awakening has shaken the pile loose."
    "起初，入口仍被先前塌方堵得严严实实，但雕像苏醒时持续不断的轰鸣震松了那堆石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_b781d625:

    # "More than once another small tremor sends pebbles and crusted snow sliding down the heap, and each time a little more cold daylight spills through the gaps."
    "不止一次，另一阵小震动让卵石和结霜的积雪从雪堆上滑落；每一次，都有更多寒冷的日光从缝隙中漏进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_7c798833:

    # "By the end, it is less a rescue than the mountain grudgingly deciding to let you leave."
    "最后，与其说是获救，不如说是山脉勉强决定放你们离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_4e71b04e:

    # "Once there is enough daylight and air again, Daggi says little, keeping the wrapped tablet tucked tight under one arm all the way back to Otsovaara."
    "天光和空气终于恢复后，达吉没说什么，只把包好的石板紧紧夹在腋下，一路带回奥察瓦拉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_ff6ff665:

    # "Herd clutches the recovered astrolabe tight against his chest, then gives you one sharp nod before looking back at the shattered stone."
    "赫德将找回的星盘紧紧抱在胸前，随后朝你利落地点了一下头，便转头看向破碎的石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_05278b14:

    # "Then a hard click rolls through the crypt from behind the broken guardians."
    "接着，一声清脆的咔哒声从破碎的守卫雕像后方穿过墓穴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_df100e68:

    # "The wall at the back of the chamber unlocks with a series of dull metallic snaps, and a narrow panel shifts aside inside the stonework."
    "房间后方的墙壁传来一连串沉闷的金属弹响，随即解锁；石墙内一块狭窄的石板向旁边移开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_94b767cc:

    # "A small tablet lies in the recess it reveals, half-buried in frost. Herd is on it before the dust settles."
    "它露出的凹室里躺着一块小石板，半埋在霜里。尘埃尚未落定，Herd就已经扑到了它面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_fe1e87ff:

    # "He wipes the slab clean with the heel of his hand. Thin hooked marks and cramped lines cover both faces, carved in an ancient language neither of you understand."
    "他用手掌根擦净石板。两面都刻满了细窄的钩形刻痕和拥挤的线条，使用的是一种你们谁都无法理解的古老语言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_ad546d8b:

    # "Herd squints, annoyed, then gives a short shake of his head."
    "Herd眯起眼睛，恼怒地短促摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_de9f0367:

    # "Beneath the lines is the worn image of a warrior wearing an antler-crown, his axe lowered at his side while roots coil around his boots."
    "线条下方刻着一个戴着鹿角王冠的战士，他的斧头垂在身侧，树根缠绕着他的靴子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_36713d5c:

    # "It fits the old bear-tribe stories of Stigandr, the ancestor who conquered the snow region and vanished into legend afterward."
    "这符合熊族关于Stigandr的古老故事：这位祖先征服了雪域，之后便消失在传说中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_7f5e5546:

    # "Even so, he turns the tablet once more in his hands and presses it against his chest beside the astrolabe, already treating it like something he means to guard himself."
    "即便如此，他还是再次在手中翻转石板，把它按在星盘旁的胸口上，已经把它当成了自己要亲自守护的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_18d1257e:

    # "He nods once, firm and immediate."
    "他坚定而迅速地点了一下头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_5e1df427:

    # "After everything that drove him into this crypt, it makes a certain kind of sense. Whatever the tablet means, he does not intend to hand it back to the tribe first and ask permission later."
    "经历了把他逼进这座墓穴的一切之后，这倒也说得通。不管石板意味着什么，他都不打算先把它交还部落、再等他们允许。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_0effd850:

    # "At the foot of the stairs, Herd slows and looks back to you."
    "走到楼梯脚下时，Herd放慢脚步，回头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_59c0f905:

    # "Two fingers touch his brow, then point at you, before curling back toward his own chest."
    "他用两根手指碰了碰眉心，随后指向你，再弯回指向自己的胸口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_f6861c0c:

    # "This time the meaning lands without either of you pretending words would help. He will look for you again."
    "这一次，你们谁也没有假装语言能派上用场，但你明白了其中的意思。他还会再来找你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_e0b1d9b1:

    # "The corner of his mouth lifts. He gives one certain nod."
    "他嘴角微微上扬，肯定地点了一下头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Herd_Route_Finish_3e86ae8b:

    # "You answer the gesture as best you can, touching your own chest before raising your hand in parting where he can see it."
    "你尽力回应这个手势，在他看得见的地方碰了碰自己的胸口，然后抬手作别。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Herd_Route_Finish_5d9e82ae:

    # "Herd presses a fist briefly to his chest in answer, then slips away up the dark stair with the astrolabe and tablet hidden under his wraps."
    "Herd也短暂地将拳头按在胸口作为回应，随后带着藏在裹布下的星盘和石板，悄悄从黑暗的楼梯上离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Herd_Route_Finish_01f43911:

    # "You stay where you are for a moment after he disappears, listening to the crypt settle around you."
    "他消失后，你在原地站了一会儿，听着墓穴在周围逐渐安静下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Herd_Route_Finish_981ae22a:

    # "The whole meeting was brief, but it did not feel small. In that cold chamber, with no shared language except patience and gesture, Herd trusted you with something he would not have trusted to his own tribe."
    "整个会面很短，却一点也不渺小。在那间冰冷的房间里，你们没有共同的语言，只有耐心和手势；而Herd把某样东西托付给了你，连自己的部落都不曾信任过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Herd_Route_Finish_80d2b692:

    # "By the time you climb out of the crypt yourself, the cave feels emptier than before, but no longer haunted by the same unfinished tension."
    "等你自己爬出墓穴时，洞穴比之前更加空荡，但那种未完的紧张感已经不再像之前那样萦绕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Herd_Route_Finish_4097474a:

    # "The whispers are gone. Herd has what he came for. All you can do now is hope he stays ahead of whatever finally drove him this far into the mountain."
    "低语声消失了。Herd拿到了他要的东西。现在你能做的只有希望，他能一直躲开那个最终把他逼入山腹深处的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_aa9d17ab:

    # "Herd clutches the recovered astrolabe tight against his chest, but before either of you can breathe easy, boots hammer down the crypt stairs."
    "Herd紧紧把找回的星盘按在胸口，但还没等你们松口气，靴子已经重重踏下墓穴楼梯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_55f58db0:

    # d "[e]!"
    d "[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_c252a91f:

    # "Commander Daggi emerges from the dark with his harpoon raised, then stops short when he sees Herd alive beside the broken statues."
    "Daggi指挥官举着鱼叉从黑暗中出现，但看到破碎雕像旁还活着的Herd时，立刻停住了脚步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_d9a086e3:

    # d "Herd..."
    d "Herd……"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_41192d68:

    # "Herd recoils so hard he nearly stumbles over the broken bronze at his heels. His shoulders seize up, his breath goes ragged, and he locks the astrolabe against his chest as though Daggi might tear it free with his bare hands."
    "Herd猛地后退，几乎被脚跟处的破碎青铜器绊倒。他的肩膀绷紧，呼吸变得急促，并把星盘死死按在胸口，仿佛Daggi会徒手把它夺走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_fcee5b9e:

    # "When Daggi takes a single step forward, Herd flinches again and throws one arm up between them on instinct."
    "Daggi向前迈出一步时，Herd又瑟缩了一下，本能地抬起一只手臂挡在两人之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_00bf9677:

    # e "Wait. The fight's over."
    e "等等，战斗结束了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_f5f76349:

    # "A hard click answers you from inside the wall behind the shattered guardians."
    "一声清脆的咔哒声从破碎的守卫雕像后方墙内回应了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_4a3f7df3:

    # "Bronze locking pins withdraw one by one, and a narrow stone recess slides open behind the pedestals. Inside rests a frost-caked tablet, no larger than your hand."
    "青铜锁栓一个接一个缩回，基座后方一处狭窄的石凹室滑开。里面放着一块结满霜的石板，不比你的手掌大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_449dc628:

    # "With both of them staring at it, you step forward first and lift the tablet free before either can snatch it. Hooked lines cover both faces, worn old enough to feel older than the crypt around you."
    "两人都盯着石板时，你先走上前，在他们任何一个人来得及抢走之前把它拿了出来。两面都刻着钩形线条，磨损得年代仿佛比周围的墓穴还要久远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_b895c124:

    # "Herd shakes his head hard enough to rattle his antlers. He points to the tablet, then to his own chest, then jerks the same hand toward Daggi with a flash of open fear before slashing one sharp gesture back toward the stairs."
    "Herd用力摇头，鹿角都随之颤动。他指指石板，又指向自己的胸口，接着带着毫不掩饰的恐惧把同一只手猛地指向Daggi，最后朝楼梯方向劈出一个利落的手势。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_fcbcfa3b:

    # e "He thinks you're going to take it."
    e "他以为你要把它拿走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_c95c7dc4:

    # "Daggi notices it at once. His grip loosens on the harpoon shaft, and he lowers the weapon until its point rests against the stone."
    "Daggi立刻察觉到了。他放松了握着鱼叉柄的手，把武器放低，直到尖端抵在石头上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_5db0af98:

    # d "I know."
    d "我知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_dfc69232:

    # d "Herd, I am not here to drag you out in chains."
    d "Herd，我不是来把你锁起来拖走的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_40fdc7bb:

    # "Herd does not believe him. He edges behind you instead, eyes locked on Daggi's hands, one shaking hand still half-lifted like a shield."
    "Herd不相信他，反而挪到你身后，双眼紧盯着Daggi的双手，一只发抖的手仍半举着，像盾牌一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_56b1435e:

    # d "I know you can't hear me... but I am not here to fight you."
    d "我知道你听不见我……但我不是来和你打架的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_211cb83f:

    # "Daggi keeps his voice level, but his eyes stay on the tablet in your hands."
    "Daggi的声音保持平稳，但目光始终落在你手里的石板上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_5699390b:

    # d "I don't know what Herd plan to do with it, but that bear relic needs to go to Chief Kaurhu before the guards turn this place into another panic."
    d "我不知道Herd打算拿它做什么，但这件熊族遗物必须在守卫们把这里变成又一场恐慌之前交给Kaurhu首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_6c1d1728:

    # d "Let me take it, and I'll keep the rest of them off Herd's trail for as long as I can."
    d "让我来拿吧，我会尽可能久地把其他人从Herd的踪迹上引开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_f3f9f9aa:

    # "As he speaks, he reaches toward the tablet with slow, careful hands, giving Herd every chance to see he is not lunging for him. It only makes Herd curl tighter behind your shoulder, panic plain in every line of him."
    "他说话时，慢慢伸手去拿石板，动作小心，给Herd充分机会看清他没有要扑过去抓人的意思。这反而让Herd更加蜷缩在你的肩后，他的每一处姿态都写满了恐慌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_5e7a42a1:

    # "You do not pull back when Daggi reaches for it. After a beat, you let him ease the tablet from your hands."
    "Daggi伸手时，你没有把石板往回拽。片刻后，你让他从你手中慢慢取走石板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_7ee76640:

    # "He wraps it at once in a strip of cloth torn from the inside of his bracer and tucks it under one arm."
    "他立刻用从护腕内侧撕下的一条布把石板包起来，塞到一只手臂下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_f5d60f84:

    # "Herd goes rigid. Terror flashes across his face before it hardens into something smaller."
    "Herd僵住了。恐惧在他脸上一闪而过，随后收紧成更隐忍的戒备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_af7b5855:

    # e "The chief needs to see this."
    e "首领需要看看这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_2b36c3e5:

    # d "And he will. Straight from me. No guard is going to turn this into another hunt."
    d "他会看的。由我亲自交给他。不会有守卫把这件事变成另一场追捕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_b15f3252:

    # d "I will tell the guards to leave you alone, but I need to get this to the chief."
    d "我会告诉守卫别来打扰你，但我得把这个交给首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_d8ebce64:

    # "He turns to Herd. Herd does not look convinced, but after a long, furious stare he backs away instead of rushing Daggi."
    "他转向Herd。Herd看起来仍不相信，但在长久而愤怒地瞪视之后，他退开了，没有冲向Daggi。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_0ad936b9:

    # "At the foot of the stairs, he pauses just long enough to meet your eyes. Resignation, perhaps."
    "在楼梯脚下，他停了一下，刚好够与你四目相对。也许，那是认命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_7f72b983:

    # "He presses the astrolabe harder to his chest and disappears soon after."
    "他把星盘更用力地按在胸口，很快便消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_737b2826:

    # "Daggi signals the others to follow him, and keeps the wrapped tablet tucked tight beneath his arm all the way back to Otsovaara."
    "Daggi示意其他人跟上他，把包好的石板紧紧夹在臂下，一路带回Otsovaara。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_a1d2302a:

    # "You pull the tablet back before Daggi can close his hand around it."
    "Daggi的手还没合拢，你就把石板抽了回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_4eba87cb:

    # e "No. Look at him."
    e "不。看看他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_d00a4f25:

    # "For a second Daggi says nothing. Herd is pressed so tight behind you that you can feel the tremor in his breathing."
    "达吉一时没有说话。赫德紧紧贴在你身后，你甚至能感到他呼吸中的颤抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_a55e21a7:

    # e "He found this all by himself. You can't just take it from him like that."
    e "这是他自己找到的。你不能就这么把它从他手里拿走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_ed61e018:

    # "You turn and press the tablet into Herd's hands. For a second he only stares, startled, before he clamps it to his chest beside the astrolabe."
    "你转身把石板按进Herd手中。他先是惊讶地盯着它看了一秒，随后把它紧紧按在胸口，放在星盘旁边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_ef9c52d0:

    # d "I understand, but Chief Kaurhu is going to hate this."
    d "我明白，但Kaurhu首领肯定会恨死这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_1d8b7828:

    # e "Maybe. But it's not yours to take. You can tell the chief about it, but you can't just take it from him."
    e "也许。但这不是你该拿走的东西。你可以把这件事告诉首领，但不能就这么从他手里夺走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_12a7ba59:

    # "For a long moment Daggi says nothing. Then he exhales through his nose and steps aside from the stairs."
    "Daggi沉默了很久。然后他从鼻子里呼出一口气，走到楼梯旁让开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_3e0cea48:

    # d "Alright, then. I'll tell my guards to leave you two alone."
    d "好吧。那么我会告诉我的守卫别来打扰你们两个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_bd938938:

    # d "I can't lie for you, [e]. And I can't guarantee Chief won't send the whole tribe crashing after him over it."
    d "我不能替你撒谎，[e]。而且我也不能保证首领不会因此派整个部落追着他不放。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Cave_Finish_Reported_Solo_0963d4dd:

    # "Herd hesitates only long enough to meet your eyes. He taps his chest with two fingers, then points those same fingers toward you in a quick, grateful motion before Daggi leaves."
    "Herd只犹豫了一瞬，便与你对上目光。他用两根手指敲了敲胸口，又用同样的手指快速指向你，带着感激，然后Daggi离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_c8124cde:

    # "By the time you reach the council hall again, Daggi has said almost nothing. Gren and Illoch remain by the doors while he steps forward and unwraps the little tablet before the throne."
    "等你们再次抵达议事厅时，Daggi几乎什么也没说。Gren和Illoch守在门边，他走上前，在王座前解开小石板上的包裹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_25c9f341:

    # d "Chief. This was sealed behind the guardians in the old crypt."
    d "首领。这是在旧墓穴的守卫后面封起来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_086e2f03:

    # kh "Old Crypt...? Why haven't I heard any of it?"
    kh "旧墓穴……？为什么我从没听说过？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_caa918d6:

    # d "Yes, Chief. The crypt seems to be hidden in the corner of the ice cave, the avalanche might have revealed the buried entrance after all."
    d "是的，首领。墓穴似乎藏在冰洞的一角，看来雪崩最终可能真的暴露了那道被掩埋的入口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_b668d69e:

    # d "When I reached the lower crypt, [e] had already found Herd alive there."
    d "我抵达下层墓穴时，[e]已经在那里找到了还活着的Herd。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_d12ccae0:

    # d "Herd escaped with the astrolabe he came for, but the courier put the tablet in my hands and I brought it straight here."
    d "Herd带着他要找的星盘逃走了，但信使把石板交到我手里，我就直接带回了这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_eb94ff6e:

    # d "The cave mouth had collapsed behind us earlier, but the fighting shook the pile loose enough for us to force a way back out."
    d "之前洞口在我们身后塌了，但战斗的震动把那堆石头震松，我们才得以强行挖出一条路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_5773b3b1:

    # d "We also found Herd's surveying bell in the lower chamber, and signs he had been working there before he died."
    d "我们还在下层房间找到了Herd的测绘铃，以及他死前曾在那里工作过的痕迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_6d0842aa:

    # d "Whatever the guards were hearing now, it was not Herd come back. But he had gone into that crypt for a reason."
    d "不管守卫现在听见的是什么，都不是Herd死而复返。但他确实有理由进入那座墓穴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_ec016f2b:

    # e "It looked more like he was tracing something hidden in the ruins than trying to frighten anyone."
    e "看起来他更像是在废墟中追查某个隐藏的东西，而不是想吓唬谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_f16280fc:

    # d "The guards were not hearing a ghost. They were hearing Herd moving through the cave and the crypt answering him."
    d "守卫听见的不是鬼魂，而是Herd在洞穴里移动，以及墓穴对他的回应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_6f1736d4:

    # e "He wasn't in there to sabotage anything. He was following the astrolabe and whatever this tablet meant."
    e "他不是进去搞破坏的。他是在追寻星盘，以及这块石板所代表的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_bb7e7270:

    # d "And Herd had been there. We found his surveying bell, fresh traces of his work, and his astrolabe jammed in the old gutter."
    d "Herd确实去过那里。我们找到了他的测绘铃、他刚留下的工作痕迹，还有卡在旧排水沟里的星盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_c7b5f080:

    # d "He was not just hiding in the dark for the sake of it. He came down there looking for something he had lost."
    d "他不是为了躲在黑暗里才待在那里。他是下去寻找自己遗失的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_f3f04a57:

    # e "We never caught up to him, but the noises the guards heard make more sense now."
    e "我们没能追上他，但现在守卫们听到的那些声音就说得通了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_a4b314ac:

    # "Kaurhu takes the tablet from him and turns it in his hands. The slab is small, but both faces are cut with dense hooked characters, worn by age and impossible to place."
    "Kaurhu从他手中接过石板，在手里翻看。石板不大，但两面都刻满密集的钩形文字，已被岁月磨损，根本无从辨认。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_42fbaff3:

    # kh "Not our language."
    kh "不是我们的语言。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_b8fed0af:

    # e "Neither of us could make sense of it."
    e "我们谁都无法理解它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_85d58c85:

    # d "It looked older than the rest of the crypt. We thought it best to bring it straight to you."
    d "看起来比墓穴其余部分都古老。我们觉得最好直接把它带给您。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_5a778aca:

    # kh "So he left traces. Not ghosts. Good."
    kh "所以他留下的是痕迹，不是鬼魂。很好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_ec7bc158:

    # kh "I will not have the tribe making a legend out of it."
    kh "我不会让部落把它编成传说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_64d3e8bb:

    # kh "So he was there after all."
    kh "所以他果然在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_ebac5f51:

    # kh "Alive, and still digging at old bones under my mountain."
    kh "还活着，而且还在我的山下挖那些古老的尸骨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_64d3e8bb_1:

    # kh "So he was there after all."
    kh "所以他果然在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_cb7606fe:

    # kh "That explains more than I expected."
    kh "这解释了不少我没想到的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_44645f01:

    # kh "Stigandr. Or someone meant to resemble him."
    kh "Stigandr。或者，某个想让人以为是他的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_c9043f3b:

    # "The old bear's thumb pauses over the carving. For the first time, his stare leaves the two of you and goes somewhere much farther away."
    "老熊的拇指停在刻痕上。第一次，他的目光离开你们两人，投向遥远得多的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_62b521cd:

    # kh "The elders said the conqueror took the great Otsovaara for the bears and vanished from the world soon after."
    kh "长老们说，那位征服者替熊族夺下了伟大的Otsovaara，不久后便从世上消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_12d70059:

    # kh "No one agrees on what happened next. Some said he died. Some said he sealed himself away. Some said he walked into the mountain and never walked out."
    kh "没人知道接下来发生了什么。有人说他死了；有人说他把自己封闭起来；还有人说他走进山中，再也没有出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_14eadf02:

    # d "I thought it was just another tale to make cubs keep away from deep snow and deeper ruins."
    d "我还以为那只是另一个用来吓唬幼崽、让他们远离深雪和更深废墟的故事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_ee0f193b:

    # "The chief studies the writing for a long moment, his frown deepening rather than easing."
    "首领久久凝视着那些文字，眉头越皱越紧，没有丝毫舒展。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_884eaa20:

    # kh "You thought right."
    kh "你猜得没错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_0042a442:

    # kh "If this was hidden under the mountain, then it stays with me until I decide who hears of it."
    kh "如果这东西是藏在山下的，那在我决定让谁知道之前，它就留在我这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_fbd48c9b:

    # "He closes his hand over the tablet and settles back into his throne."
    "他用手掌盖住石板，靠回王座。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_8fcfa734:

    # kh "Courier. You kept quiet, followed my commander's lead, and brought this to the proper hall. That is enough."
    kh "信使。你守口如瓶，听从我指挥官的安排，把这个带到了该去的大厅。这就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_fccd44fd:

    # e "Then I'm free to go?"
    e "那我可以走了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_01a02f0f:

    # kh "Yes. Go."
    kh "是。走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_9f0463b7:

    # d "Thank you, Chief."
    d "谢谢您，首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_4258ca79:

    # kh "I was speaking to the courier, cub. You stay."
    kh "我在跟信使说话，小崽子。你留下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_4be86d13:

    # "Daggi straightens at once, ears flicking once in embarrassed acknowledgment."
    "Daggi立刻挺直身子，耳朵轻轻一抖，尴尬地表示明白。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_84fa9cae:

    # d "...Yes, Chief."
    d "……是，首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Bear_Guard_Crypt_Tablet_Report_d9576d6e:

    # "Before turning back to the throne, he gives you one brief glance that lands somewhere between thanks and apology."
    "转回王座前，他短暂地看了你一眼，那目光介于感谢与歉意之间。"
